{"overview":"رنتارو آیجو در دورهٔ متوسطه ۱۰۰ بار رد شد. او به یک معبد می‌رود و برای شانس بهتر در دبیرستان دعا می‌کند. خدای عشق ظاهر می‌شود و وعده می‌دهد که به زودی ۱۰۰ نفر را که سرنوشت او را برای قرار ملاقات تعیین کرده است، ملاقات خواهد کرد؛ اما شرط این است که وقتی سرنوشت کسی را به او معرفی کرد، هر دو باید خوشبختانه یکدیگر را دوست داشته باشند، وگرنه می‌میرند. سرنوشت رنتارو و ۱۰۰ دوست‌دخترش در دبیرستان چه خواهد شد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Rentaro Aijo was rejected 100 times in middle school. He visits a shrine and prays for better luck in high school. The God of Love appears and promises that he'll soon meet 100 people he's destined to date. But there's a catch—once destiny introduces someone to him, the two must happily love each other. If they don't, they'll die. What will befall Rentaro and his 100 girlfriends in high school?","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":36,"y":2023,"poster":"/fOfFcOays1whjqBOEkEznVgyhVi.jpg"}],"episodes":36,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"加藤渉","role":"Rentaro Aijo (voice)","photo":"/7PUe94Ju0klZfEutSSbdOJyaV0y.jpg","en":"Wataru Katoh"},{"name":"کائده هوندو","role":"Hakari Hanazono (voice)","photo":"/11BcHnuJYrOZhIftgUiQqfm7TK6.jpg","en":"Kaede Hondo"},{"name":"富田美憂","role":"Karane Inda (voice)","photo":"/rSR17l4HdchLkhpRuAZbGbXNmUS.jpg","en":"Miyu Tomita"},{"name":"ماریا ناگاناوا","role":"Shizuka Yoshimoto (voice)","photo":"/tt0j0z34Oq3MyvDA3VeizskWcw4.jpg","en":"Maria Naganawa"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Nano Eiai (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"朝井彩加","role":"Kusuri Yakuzen (voice)","photo":"/tQCblqK0CJfddLPkYKcI94R2Pgh.jpg","en":"Ayaka Asai"},{"name":"千葉繁","role":"God (voice)","photo":"/mF5YJxApTYKBVFJDrEC9IrJ5ooV.jpg","en":"Shigeru Chiba"}],"trailer":"ls2VNcSifi4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/223564-100/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC